OL,3,GNEWSAHospital development aims to      
OL,4,Areduce admissions                      
OL,6,FA Surrey hospital says a multi-million 
OL,7,Fpound development will improve its     
OL,8,Femergency department and add a new     
OL,9,Fdedicated paediatric assessment unit.  
OL,11,FThe development at St Peter's Hospital 
OL,12,Fin Chertsey, which is being supported  
OL,13,Fby about #13m from NHS England, is due 
OL,14,Fto start this winter and scheduled to  
OL,15,Ftake a year.                           
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
