OL,3,GNEWSAHospital development aims to      
OL,4,Areduce admissions                      
OL,6,FIt aims to improve the hospital's      
OL,7,Fcapacity to care for patients with     
OL,8,Fserious but non-life-threatening       
OL,9,Fconditions who can be treated and      
OL,10,Fdischarged on the same day, reducing   
OL,11,Fthe need for hospital admission, the   
OL,12,FAshford and St Peter's Hospitals NHS   
OL,13,FFoundation Trust says.                 
OL,15,FThe trust says the development will    
OL,16,Freduce reliance on temporary escalation
OL,17,Fareas and create more resilient        
OL,18,Fservices.                              
